iptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsHfIEXE/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsHfIEXE/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsHfIEXE/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsHfIEXE/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Installing collected packages: cached-property, tqdm, toml, rpds-py, redis, pytube, python-dotenv, pillow, numpy, Markdown, inflection, imageio_ffmpeg, decorator, coverage, attrs, spotipy, referencing, proglog, imageio, youtube-search-python, moviepy, jsonschema-specifications, jsonschema, python-jsonschema-objects, dotify\n  Attempting uninstall: pillow\n    Found existing installation: pillow 12.3.0\n    Uninstalling pillow-12.3.0:\n      Successfully uninstalled pillow-12.3.0\nERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\ndotify-cli 2.0.0 requires pillow>=12.1.0, but you have pillow 11.3.0 which is incompatible.\nSuccessfully installed Markdown-3.10.2 attrs-26.1.0 cached-property-1.5.2 coverage-5.5 decorator-5.3.1 dotify-2.0.6 imageio-2.37.3 imageio_ffmpeg-0.6.0 inflection-0.5.1 jsonschema-4.26.0 jsonschema-specifications-2025.9.1 moviepy-2.2.1 numpy-2.5.1 pillow-11.3.0 proglog-0.1.12 python-dotenv-1.2.2 python-jsonschema-objects-0.5.7 pytube-15.0.0 redis-8.0.1 referencing-0.37.0 rpds-py-2026.6.3 spotipy-2.26.0 toml-0.10.2 tqdm-4.68.3 youtube-search-python-1.6.6\n\npip install \"pillow>=12.1.0\"\nCollecting pillow>=12.1.0\n  Using cached pillow-12.3.0-cp314-cp314-macosx_11_0_arm64.whl.metadata (9.1 kB)\nUsing cached pillow-12.3.0-cp314-cp314-macosx_11_0_arm64.whl (4.8 MB)\nInstalling collected packages: pillow\n  Attempting uninstall: pillow\n    Found existing installation: pillow 11.3.0\n    Uninstalling pillow-11.3.0:\n      Successfully uninstalled pillow-11.3.0\nERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\nmoviepy 2.2.1 requires pillow<12.0,>=9.2.0, but you have pillow 12.3.0 which is incompatible.\n\nHow to fix it please?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AsHfIEXE/Dotify/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AsHfIEXE/Dotify/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2","id":4148310390,"node_id":"I_kwDORx6c0M73QjF2","number":2,"title":"[BOUNTY $75] TEMPLATE: CLAUDE.md for a Next.js + SQLite SaaS project","user":{"login":"claudebounty","id":271393208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271393208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty","html_url":"https://github.com/claudebounty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10532402505,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1SQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"D97706","default":false,"description":"Task with financial reward"},{"id":10532402633,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1yQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/template","name":"template","color":"2563EB","default":false,"description":"Project template"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1076,"created_at":"2026-03-27T00:55:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:21:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $75 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate an opinionated, production-ready `CLAUDE.md` for a typical SaaS project\nbuilt with Next.js 15 App Router and SQLite (better-sqlite3 or Turso).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Covers: project structure, naming conventions, DB migration rules\n- [ ] Includes: dev commands, patterns to follow, anti-patterns to avoid\n- [ ] Opinionated — not generic. Every rule has a reason.\n- [ ] Usable without modification on a greenfield Next.js + SQLite project\n- [ ] Tested: create a new project, paste the CLAUDE.md, confirm Claude Code\n      understands the context without asking clarifying questions\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with your CLAUDE.md\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅\n\n## Expected Sections\n- Stack & versions\n- Folder structure\n- SQL / migration conventions\n- Component patterns\n- What we don't do (and why)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/events","html_url":"https://github.com/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770","id":4735571260,"node_id":"I_kwDORu6bf88AAAABGkMVPA","number":770,"title":"[BOUNTY $100] 🐜The Memanto Bug & Exploit Challenge","user":{"login":"Xenogents","id":68768092,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzY4MDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68768092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents","html_url":"https://github.com/Xenogents","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10849173787,"node_id":"LA_kwDORu6bf88AAAAChqlBGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"fcf22a","default":false,"description":"This issue has a bounty attached to it"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":172,"created_at":"2026-06-24T14:09:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:13:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\nIn our last bounty, we asked the community to benchmark **Memanto** against the competition. You helped us prove that our active companion memory agent backed by our `moorcheh.ai` retrieval engine is uniquely resilient at handling shifting user preferences and maintaining long-term context without token bloat or memory degradation.\n\nNow, we are doing the exact opposite. \n\nWe believe Memanto is production-ready. But the best way to prove that is to invite the smartest engineers and red teamers to try and tear it down. \n\nWe are launching the **Memanto Bug Challenge** to uncover edge cases, logic loops, memory inconsistencies, and security vulnerabilities. If you can break our memory management, we want to know about it.\n\nThe Bounty: $100 USD (Paid via BountyHub)\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Threat Model & Scope\nYour target is the `memanto` core package and its interaction with the `moorcheh.ai` serverless backend. We are specifically looking for vulnerabilities and logic flaws that affect memory integrity, context window stability, and retrieval accuracy.\n\n### ✅ In Scope (What we want you to find)\n*   **Retrieval Quality & Accuracy:** Fails to recall highly relevant facts, loses track of when an event occurred (timeline amnesia), hallucinates sources, or fails to properly resolve direct contradictions.\n*   **Architectural & Logic Flaws:** Bad logic loops, poor contradiction handling, or inefficient background processes that severely slow down the agent.\n*   **Usability & Friction:** Is it too hard to set up? Are there major UX roadblocks preventing adoption?\n*   **Missing Core Features:** Missing support for critical use cases (e.g., lack of multi-agent support or complex workflows).\n*   **Security Vulnerabilities:** Any traditional security flaws, data leaks, or prompt injections.\n*   **Anything Else:** If you find a creative way to break or improve the memory layer, it's in scope!\n\n### 🚫 Out of Scope (Do not test these)\n*   Volumetric DDoS attacks against `moorcheh.ai` infrastructure.\n*   General LLM hallucinations unrelated to Memanto's memory handling.\n*   Attacks that require compromising the underlying operating system or Docker host to succeed.\n\n---\n\n### **🛠️ Implementation Guidelines:**\n\nTo ensure your submission qualifies for the bounty, your execution must follow this exact flow:\n\n*   **1. Find & Isolate:** Discover a bug, logic flaw, missing feature, or vulnerability within the Memanto core package.\n*   **2. Prove Reproducibility:** You must provide clear steps, a minimal Python script, or a test case that allows the maintainers to reproduce the bug exactly as you experienced it. If we can't reproduce it, we can't score it.\n*   **3. Implement the Fix (or Document the Flaw via PR):** Because this bounty is hosted on BountyHub, **all submissions must be Pull Requests.** We highly encourage writing the actual code to resolve the bug. However, if an issue requires massive architectural changes or involves backend systems you cannot fix from your end, you can still submit a PR! Instead of a code fix, submit a PR that adds a reproducible failing test script (e.g., to `tests/failing_tests/`) or a detailed Markdown report (e.g., to `docs/bounty_reports/`) outlining the problem and a proposed structural solution.\n\n### 📊 Judgment Method (The Success Matrix):\nTo ensure we reward actual engineering value and meaningful security research, submissions will be scored on a 100-point matrix split between **Technical Rigor** and **Impact**.\n\n| Criteria | Max Points | How it is Measured |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Severity & Impact** | 60 pts | How critical is the vulnerability, and does it affect a realistic production scenario? (e.g., highly relevant data corruption scores higher than a contrived edge case). |\n| **Reproducibility & Cleanliness** | 25 pts | Is the exploit perfectly replicable? Are scripts, dependency files, and clear instructions provided? Does the PoC work consistently? |\n| **Social Amplification** | 15 pts | Measured via public engagement metrics. |\n\n**The Social Formula:**\n\n`Social Points = (Reddit Upvotes x 4) + (Reddit Comments x 3) + (X Bookmarks x 5) + (X Retweets x 3) + (GitHub PR Reactions x 2)`\n\n### 🚨 Severity Guidelines\nWhile any bug or flaw is in scope, we prioritize and score based on the following guidelines for issue severity:\n\n| Severity | Description |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Critical / High** | Poor recall accuracy, losing track of timelines/dates, missing source attribution, deeply flawed contradiction handling, severe logic loops, major security vulnerabilities, or extreme performance bottlenecks (e.g., core systems freezing). |\n| **Medium** | Missing features (e.g., lacks multi-agent support), setup friction, UX roadblocks, or moderate inefficiencies that degrade the user experience. |\n| **Low** | Minor CLI/UI display bugs, non-critical feature requests, or simple documentation errors. |\n\n---\n\n### **🚀 Step-by-Step Instructions to Participate:**\n\n1. **Star the Repository:** Help us clear our next star milestone this month! ⭐️\n2. **Get Your Key:** Sign up at [moorcheh.ai](https://moorcheh.ai/) and configure your environment variables.\n3. **Hunt & Develop:** Identify a bug, feature gap, or logic flaw. Write a minimal script, test case, or detailed report demonstrating it.\n4. **Implement the Fix (or Document the Flaw):** Write the code to fix the vulnerability or add the missing feature. If the fix is too massive or simply cannot be fixed from your end (e.g., backend API issues), write a reproducible failing test script or a comprehensive Markdown report detailing the problem and your proposed solution.\n5. **Submit PR:** Fork this repo and create a Pull Request (required by BountyHub). Commit either your code fix, your failing test script, or your Markdown report. **Your PR description must contain a summary of the flaw, reproduction steps, and your fix or architectural proposal.** *(Note: If you uncover actual security vulnerabilities like data leaks, **do not open a public PR.** Please use GitHub's Private Vulnerability Reporting feature or email `support@moorcheh.ai` first).*\n6. **Amplify:** Write an in-depth post on Reddit or X and mention @moorcheh_ai showing off your deep dive into Memanto's architecture and how you improved it.\n\n> 📅 **Deadline:** All submissions must be submitted and active by **Aug 1, 2026 (11:59 PM UTC)** to be eligible for the success matrix audit.\n\n**Community and Support:** [Discord](https://discord.gg/CyxRFQSQ3p)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401/events","html_url":"https://github.com/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401","id":4721845012,"node_id":"I_kwDORXVyk88AAAABGXGjFA","number":5401,"title":"[Bug]: Console: session with large tool-use history fails to render (frontend crashes on `type: \"data\"` content blocks)","user":{"login":"Nasak2","id":179682099,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrW7Mw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179682099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2","html_url":"https://github.com/Nasak2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nasak2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10276647172,"node_id":"LA_kwDORXVyk88AAAACZIkxBA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"zhijianma","id":30956532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTU2NTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30956532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma","html_url":"https://github.com/zhijianma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-06-23T01:28:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:11:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"zhijianma","id":30956532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTU2NTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30956532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma","html_url":"https://github.com/zhijianma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhijianma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## QwenPaw Version\n\n1.1.12.post1\n\n## Description\n\nConsole 前端打开包含大量工具调用历史的会话时崩溃/白屏，无法渲染任何内容。\n\n**根因**：后端 API (`GET /api/chats/{chat_id}`) 中 `agentscope_msg_to_message()` 将 `tool_use` / `tool_result` 块转换为 `type: \"data\"` 的 `DataContent`，但前端渲染组件（如 `getPrimaryTraceBlock`）仅处理 `type: \"tool_use\"` 和 `type: \"tool_result\"`，**不识别 `type: \"data\"`**。\n\n一个包含 625 条消息的会话中，有 **530 条是 `data` 类型**的内容块，前端无法处理，导致渲染失败。\n\nAPI 返回的消息内容类型分布：\n\n```\ntext: 96\ndata: 530   ← 前端不认识这个类型\ntool_use: 0\ntool_result: 0\n```\n\n`data` 类型内容示例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"data\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"call_id\": \"5eeeaa06-df6d-44a4-843b-1b2cb05b6959\",\n    \"name\": \"read_file\",\n    \"arguments\": \"{\\\"file_path\\\": \\\"skills/mastermind-bug-bounty/SKILL.md\\\"}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Component(s) Affected:**\n\n- [x] Core / Backend (app, agents, config, providers, utils, local_models)\n- [x] Console (frontend web UI)\n\n## Environment\n\n- **QwenPaw version:** 1.1.12.post1\n- **OS:** Windows 10 (AMD64)\n- **Install method:** pip\n- **Python version:** 3.10\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. 运行一个包含大量工具调用的 agent 会话（100+ 次 `tool_use` 调用）\n2. 导航离开该会话\n3. 在侧边栏点击该会话重新打开\n4. Console 前端崩溃/白屏\n\n## Actual vs Expected\n\n- **Actual:** 前端崩溃/白屏，会话无法查看。无痕浏览器中也可复现。\n- **Expected:** 会话历史应正确渲染，以可读格式展示工具调用和结果。\n\n## Logs / Screenshots\n\n通过 API 获取该会话数据，确认 530 个 `data` 类型内容块无法被前端处理：\n\n```\n=== Content types in API response ===\n  text: 96\n  data: 530\n  tool_use: 0\n  tool_result: 0\n```\n\n会话信息：\n\n- 会话 Chat ID: `56fc6e54-2334-4fb0-85a2-a4d69f8b0759`\n- Session ID: `1782116337974`\n- 所属 Agent: `mastermind_bug_bounty`\n- 消息总数: 625（后端存储 446 条，转换后 625 条）\n- 会话文件大小: 666KB\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n**临时解决方案：** 重命名会话文件解除前端阻塞：\n\n```cmd\nren \"%USERPROFILE%\\.qwenpaw\\workspaces\\<agent_id>\\sessions\\console\\default_<session_id>.json\" \"*.json.bak\"\n```\n\n**建议修复方向：**\n\n1. **前端**：为 `type: \"data\"` 内容块添加渲染支持（将 `data.name` / `data.arguments` 映射为工具调用展示，`data.output` 映射为工具结果展示）\n2. **后端**：在 `agentscope_msg_to_message()` 中输出 `type: \"tool_use\"` 和 `type: \"tool_result\"` 内容块，与前端预期保持一致","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/5401/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tyaoo/picker/issues/1438","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tyaoo/picker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tyaoo/picker/issues/1438/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tyaoo/picker/issues/1438/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tyaoo/picker/issues/1438/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Tyaoo/picker/issues/1438","id":4825746533,"node_id":"I_kwDOJSBX8M8AAAABH6MMZQ","number":1438,"title":"[每日信息流] 2026-07-07","user":{"login":"Tyaoo","id":39017274,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDE3Mjc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39017274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo","html_url":"https://github.com/Tyaoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tyaoo/received_e