:"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","id":4195435600,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EURQ","number":2782,"title":"[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1358,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:16:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 2 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nHelp us review code. Every PR benefits from a second pair of eyes.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any open PR** from [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pulls), [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pulls), or [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pulls)\n2. **Read the code changes** (click \"Files changed\" tab)\n3. **Leave a substantive review comment**. Examples:\n   - \"Line 42: this SQL query isn't parameterized, potential injection\"\n   - \"This function duplicates logic already in utils.py line 80\"\n   - \"Missing error handling if the API returns non-200\"\n   - \"Good approach, but the variable name should describe what it holds\"\n4. **Comment here** with a link to your review\n\n### What Counts\n- Review must be **technical and specific** (not \"looks good\" or \"nice work\")\n- Point to specific lines with specific observations\n- Positive observations count too (\"good use of context manager here\")\n- You don't need to be an expert. Asking good questions is reviewing.\n\n### Payment\n2 RTC once your review contains at least 2 substantive observations.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Can read Python or JavaScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905","id":4814058294,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABHvCzNg","number":10905,"title":"Bug: Admin metrics accepts any authenticated role","user":{"login":"es3298","id":195702768,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6ov8A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195702768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298","html_url":"https://github.com/es3298","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es3298/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-05T18:59:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:01:57Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent bounty: #743\n\nThis issue is limited only to the creator of this issue. This means that only the issue author can attempt to solve this issue. If you would like to work on it, please create another issue with the same contents and refer to issue #743 for more information.\n\n## Bug\n`/api/admin` routes authenticate the request JWT but do not verify that the authenticated principal has an admin role. Any valid client or freelancer token can call `GET /api/admin/metrics` and receive admin metrics.\n\n## Expected\n- Missing/invalid tokens should still return 401.\n- Valid non-admin tokens should return 403.\n- Valid admin tokens should continue to access admin metrics.\n- Add focused route coverage for all three cases.\n\n## Impact\nThis is a privilege escalation issue: admin-only data is exposed to any authenticated user.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10905/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/442","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/442/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.c