pdate documentation to remove references to this endpoint\n3. Or redirect to the correct endpoint path if renamed\n\n### Environment\n- Tested on: 2026-07-07\n- Browser/API client: Direct HTTP request\n- Region: US\n\n---\n\n**Disclosure**: This bug report was submitted as part of the ONBOARD bounty program (#2781). I received RTC compensation for this contribution.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7910/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7910/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7","id":271788800,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNzE3ODg4MDA=","number":7,"title":"New daily trending repos in Python","user":{"login":"vitalets","id":1473072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NzMwNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1473072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets","html_url":"https://github.com/vitalets","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co