"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luccas12348486/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Bounty: CRDT Conflict Resolution Bypass → Data Corruption\n\n**难度:** Expert | **奖励:** $100 USD\n\n### 漏洞描述\n此漏洞描述了一个常见的安全问题: CRDT Conflict Resolution Bypass → Data Corruption。需要提交修复代码。\n\n### 提交要求\n- 提交修复代码（Python/JavaScript）\n- 在 issue 评论中以代码块形式提交\n- 也可以创建 Pull Request\n\n### 评估标准\n- 代码正确修复了安全漏洞\n- 没有引入新的安全问题\n- 代码简洁且有效\n\n---\n*任务由 Daily Task Generator 自动创建*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/438/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170","id":4821656440,"node_id":"I_kwDOSI9KIM8AAAABH2SjeA","number":170,"title":"[EPIC] Gemini Lives — persistent world: calendar, NPC schedules, living cast","user":{"login":"mpfaffenberger","id":5629756,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Mjk3NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5629756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger","html_url":"https://github.com/mpfaffenberger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpfaffenberger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10754133751,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSI9KIM8AAAACgP8O9w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"},{"id":11314374924,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSI9KIM8AAAAComOpDA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/labels/epic","name":"epic","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Tracking issue spanning multiple tasks"},{"id":11436459898,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSI9KIM8AAAACqaqHeg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/labels/persistent-world","name":"persistent-world","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Gemini Lives: calendar, NPC schedules, living world"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-06T17:43:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T23:53:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> **Work-in-isolation:** This issue is designed to be workable with NO other\n> epic issue merged. All shared interfaces are FROZEN in\n> [`docs/persistent_world_contracts.md`](../blob/main/docs/persistent_world_contracts.md)\n> (contracts all, C1-C9); design rationale in\n> [`docs/persistent_world_plan.md`](../blob/main/docs/persistent_world_plan.md).\n> Stub guidance: see the per-issue cheat-sheet at the bottom of the contracts doc.\n\nUmbrella epic for the persistent-world expansion designed in `docs/persistent_world_plan.md`.\n\n**Setting anchor (canon):** Year 2669 — the Concordia is lost at Vespus mid-year (2669.243); Confed is losing the war and it's classified. Gemini feels the squeeze: militia stretched thin, pirates bold, Retros surging, Kilrathi probing deeper than they should.\n\n## Pillars\n\n1. **Canon calendar** — decimal stardates `YYYY.DDD` (Claw Marks `2654.110`, WC3 `2669.243`). Game starts 2669.135; every landing advances one day. Quarterly economic/flavor cycles, no fictional \"seasons\".\n2. **~40 named NPCs** — canonical expansions (Tayla, Lynn Murphy, Sandra Goodin, Taryn Cross, Miggs) + ~17 new characters across merchants, pirates, bounty hunters, Retros, Confed, Kilrathi.\n3. **Fixed schedules** — every scheduled NPC follows a deterministic manifest: `leg = legs[day % period_days]`. Pure function of the calendar; zero extra save-state; learnable by the player (the Freelancer/Stardew effect). Schedule intersections (Murphy's patrol crossing Krieg's raid lane) create emergent-feeling moments for free.\n4. **Scripted Grayson interactions** — Tier 1: schedule-aware comm barks. Tier 2: ~10 authored cinematics via the existing Studio pipeline.\n5. **The Defector** — Ghraffid nar Hhallas, Kamekh commander hiding in the deep fringe (Lisacc / 41-GS / DN-N1912 / Varnus / KM-252 rotation).\n\n## Child issues\n\n- [ ] #171 World clock: canon stardates + savegame v8\n- [ ] #172 NPC schedule manifests + npc_director module + schedule lint\n- [ ] #173 Named-NPC spawns: invulnerable (retreat-not-die), names in targeting/comms\n- [ ] #174 Cinematic trigger extensions (npc_present, day gates) + Tier-1 barks\n- [ ] #175 Cast: merchants & freighter captains\n- [ ] #176 Cast: pirates & bounty hunters\n- [ ] #177 Cast: Retros\n- [ ] #178 Cast: Confed\n- [ ] #179 BUG: Kilrathi voice pipeline rebuild\n- [ ] #180 Cast: Kilrathi rivals\n- [ ] #181 The Defector: Ghraffid nar Hhallas arc\n- [ ] #182 Tier-2 cinematics batch (10 scenes)\n\n## Design decisions already made\n\n- Fixed/deterministic schedules for everyone (approved).\n- Humboldt and Potter are QUADRANTS, not systems — Reesa & Vance's run is Troy -> Junction -> New Detroit and back (6-day loop).\n- Named NPCs are interim-invulnerable: below 10% hull they disengage and jump out; they never pop.\n- Full plan: `docs/persistent_world_plan.md`.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mpfaffenberger/space_sim/issues/170/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iii123iii/Crystal-PDF/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iii123iii/Crystal-PDF","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iii123iii/Crystal-PDF/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"ht