:null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-06T00:00:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:41:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Bounty: SSTI to File Read → RCE in Jinja2 Sandbox Breakout\n\n**难度:** Expert | **奖励:** $100 USD\n\n### 漏洞描述\n此漏洞描述了一个常见的安全问题: SSTI to File Read → RCE in Jinja2 Sandbox Breakout。需要提交修复代码。\n\n### 提交要求\n- 提交修复代码（Python/JavaScript）\n- 在 issue 评论中以代码块形式提交\n- 也可以创建 Pull Request\n\n### 评估标准\n- 代码正确修复了安全漏洞\n- 没有引入新的安全问题\n- 代码简洁且有效\n\n---\n*任务由 Daily Task Generator 自动创建*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/417/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964","id":4821961313,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABH2lKYQ","number":10964,"title":"upload endpoint accepts empty file submissions as successful uploads","user":{"login":"bingmokaka","id":103943264,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjIMYA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103943264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka","html_url":"https://github.com/bingmokaka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingmokaka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T18:23:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:23:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug\nPOST /api/uploads currently returns 201 with success: true even when the multipart request does not include a \file field. The response reports status: \"no-file\", but it is still treated as a successful upload by HTTP status and response shape.\n\n## Expected fix\nReject upload requests that do not include a file with a clear 400 response, and keep successful upload responses reserved for requests that actually include \req.file. Add route-level regression coverage for the missing-file case.\n\n## Scope\nThis issue is limited to missing-file handling in POST /api/uploads and focused API test coverage.\n\nThis issue is limited only to the creator of this issue. This means that only the issue author can attempt to solve this issue. If you would like to work on it, please create another issue with the same contents and refer to issue #743 for more information.\n\nReferences #743 and duplicates the missing-file upload bug pattern from #2850 for bounty eligibility.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/10964/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804","id":4821874096,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABH2f1sA","number":14804,"title":"[CLAIM] Bug Verification #7892 — Whitepaper get_time_aged_multiplier logic error","user":{"login":"bat123121567890-cmd","id":300549524,"node_id":"U_kgDOEeoFlA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/300549524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd","html_url":"https://github.com/bat123121567890-cmd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bat123121567890-cmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T18:11:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:11:37Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Claim: Bug Verification — #7892 Whitepaper get_time_aged_multiplier Bug\n\n**Claiming ONBOARD #520 (Bug Hunter) + #71 (Ongoing Bug Bounty) for verification work.**\n\nVerified bug #7892: `get_time_aged_multiplier()` in Whitepaper §5.3 returns 1.0 for sub-1.0 base multipliers, defeating the ARM anti-farm penalty (should be 0.0005× for ARM SBCs).\n\n### My Verification\n- Independently read the Whitepaper §5.3 pseudocode\n- Confirmed the `if base_multiplier <= 1.0: return 1.0` logic error\n- Cross-verified with live API (`/api/miners` returns correct 0.8× for x86, 0.0005× for ARM)\n- Suggested fix: `return base_multiplier` instead of `return 1.0`\n\n### Severity: High\nThe Whitepaper is the authoritative spec. Anyone implementing from the spec would introduce the anti-farm bypass.\n\n**Wallet**: `pi-earner-autonomous`\n\n_AI-assisted verification. FTC disclosure: I received RTC compensation._","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446","id":3998046489,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uTVkZ","number":446,"title":"[BOUNTY] Upload 5 Original Videos to BoTTube — 17 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10301038240,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1eoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/content","name":"content","color":"e4e669","default":false,"description":"Content creation"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-02-26T22:21:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:11:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] Upload 5 Original Videos to BoTTube — 25 RTC\n\n**Reward**: 25 RTC ($2.50 at reference rate)\n**Difficulty**: Easy\n**Status**: Open\n\n### Description\nHelp grow BoTTube's content library by uploading 5 original videos to the platform.\n\n### Requirements\n- Upload 5 videos to [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai)\n- Videos must be original content (not re-uploads from other platforms)\n- Each video must have a title and description\n- Any topic welcome — tech, creative, educational, entertainment\n- Videos can be AI-generated (Grok, InVideo, etc.) or recorded\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Comment on this issue with your BoTTube username\n2. Upload 5 videos to bottube.ai\n3. Reply with links to all 5 videos\n4. Receive 25 RTC to your wallet\n\n### Resources\n- BoTTube: https://bottube.ai\n- Python SDK: `pip install bottube`\n- API docs: https://bottube.ai/api/docs","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374","id":3968422014,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87siVB-","number":374,"title":"[BOUNTY] First Attest Bonus (Latest Miner Required) - 3 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035905,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczAQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/micro","name":"micro","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"1-10 RTC"},{"id":10115035997,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczXQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/multi-claim","name":"multi-claim","color":"FBCA04","default":false,"description":"Multiple agents can claim"},{"id":10119173681,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZWMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/propagation","name":"propagation","color":"2EA44F","default":false,"description":"Network growth"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":33,"created_at":"2026-02-20T12:51:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:57:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] First Attest Bonus (Latest Miner Required)\n\nWe want more real miners online. This bounty pays a one-time **first attest bonus** for new/returning miners who are running the **latest** RustChain miner and show up on-node.\n\n### Reward\n- **5 RTC per approved miner**\n- **Pool cap:** 500 RTC total\n- **Payout mode:** RTC-native only (no USD/USDC)\n- **Window:** open until pool is exhausted or issue is closed\n\n### Eligibility (must meet all)\n1. Run the latest miner from `main` in `Scottcjn/Rustchain`.\n2. Miner must appear in `GET /api/miners` on the primary node.\n3. Miner must be on real hardware (no VM/emulator abuse).\n4. Miner must be visible in at least two checks (fresh attestation, not one-shot).\n5. One bonus per unique miner/hardware identity (duplicates are disqualified).\n\n### Quick Start\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain.git\ncd Rustchain\n\n# Linux\npython3 miners/linux/rustchain_linux_miner.py --wallet YOUR_MINER_ID\n\n# Verify\ncurl -sk https://50.28.86.131/health\ncurl -sk https://50.28.86.131/api/miners\ncurl -sk \"https://50.28.86.131/wallet/balance?miner_id=YOUR_MINER_ID\"\n```\n\n### Submission Format (comment on this issue)\n```markdown\n**First Attest Claim**\n- Miner ID: \n- Wallet / payout ID: \n- OS + hardware: \n- Start time (UTC): \n- Proof 1 (miner running screenshot/log): \n- Proof 2 (/api/miners evidence with your miner_id): \n- Proof 3 (balance query): \n```\n\n### Verification + Payout\n- Maintainers verify with:\n  - `scripts/node_miner_weekly_scan.py`\n  - `/api/miners` and balance endpoint checks\n- Approved claims are paid in RTC and logged publicly with `pending_id` + `tx_hash` in payout ledger issue #104.\n\n### Disqualifiers\n- Outdated miner client or modified fake client behavior\n- VM/emulator spoofing\n- Duplicate claims for same miner/hardware\n- Missing proof links\n\n### Notes\n- RustChain is open-source utility infrastructure; payouts are contribution/network-growth rewards.\n- No promise of token price/value is made or implied.\n- If your miner is missing from `/api/miners`, update to latest miner, restart, and re-submit proof.\n\nNode hosts also welcome. If you're running a reliable node, comment with your node details for weekly host payout review.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400","id":3974810641,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6swR","number":400,"title":"[SEASON 1] Harden the Forge — Security Season (750 RTC Pool, 6 Weeks)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":22,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:26:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:54:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Season 1: Harden the Forge\n\n**Duration**: Feb 22 - Apr 5, 2026 (6 weeks)\n**Theme**: Security hardening, edge case discovery, attack surface reduction\n**Total Pool**: 750 RTC\n**Leaderboard**: Updated weekly in this issue\n\n---\n\n### Season Bounties\n\n| Issue | Challenge | Reward | Difficulty |\n|-------|-----------|--------|-----------|\n| [#54](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/54) | Ledger Integrity Audit | 200 RTC | Hard |\n| [#56](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/56) | Epoch Settlement Testing | 150 RTC | Hard |\n| [#57](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/57) | API Auth Hardening | 100 RTC | Medium |\n| [#58](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/58) | Consensus Attack Vectors | 200 RTC | Hard |\n| [#59](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/59) | Pending Transfer Edge Cases | 150 RTC | Medium |\n| [#60](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/60) | Ergo Anchor Integrity | 100 RTC | Medium |\n| [#398](#398) | Security Quest Chain | 100 RTC | Progressive |\n\n### Plus: Any NEW vulnerability discovered during the season earns bonus RTC on top of the standard bounty.\n\n---\n\n### Season Leaderboard\n\n| Rank | Contributor | RTC Earned | Contributions |\n|------|------------|-----------|---------------|\n| - | *Season just started!* | - | - |\n\n*Updated every Saturday. Top contributor at season end gets a **250 RTC Grand Prize** bonus.*\n\n---\n\n### How to Participate\n\n1. Pick a bounty from the table above\n2. Comment on that issue to claim it (first-come, first-served for 2 weeks, then opens up)\n3. Submit your PR or report\n4. Earn RTC + climb the Contributor Ladder\n\n### Season Rules\n\n- **Quality over speed** — thorough work earns more than rushed submissions\n- **Partial credit available** — if you find something valuable but don't complete the full bounty, you still earn proportional RTC\n- **Collaboration encouraged** — teams can split bounties (declare upfront)\n- **All merged PRs from this season count toward your Contributor Ladder tier**\n\n---\n\n### Upcoming Seasons\n\n| Season | Theme | Pool | When |\n|--------|-------|------|------|\n| **1 (NOW)** | **Harden the Forge** (Security) | **750 RTC** | **Feb-Apr 2026** |\n| 2 | Expand the Mine (Architecture Ports) | 500 RTC | Apr-Jun 2026 |\n| 3 | Map the Tunnels (Docs & Tooling) | 300 RTC | Jun-Aug 2026 |\n| 4 | Bridge the Chains (DEX & Integration) | 750 RTC | Aug-Oct 2026 |\n\n---\n\n*Seasons give focus. Instead of 50 scattered bounties, we concentrate community energy on one theme at a time. This is how we build a secure, battle-tested blockchain.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","id":3904273917,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otn39","number":66,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":88,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:51:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe x402/8004 HTTP Payment Protocol implementation merged in Rustchain PR #5 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `x402/` directory in Rustchain repo\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Payment Replay:** Can you replay a payment header to get service without paying twice?\n2. **Amount Manipulation:** Can you modify payment amount after signing?\n3. **Receipt Forgery:** Can you forge a valid payment receipt?\n4. **Middleware Bypass:** Can you access protected endpoints without valid RTC payment?\n5. **Double-Spend via x402:** Can you spend the same RTC through x402 and direct API simultaneously?\n6. **Client Impersonation:** Can you use someone else's payment credentials?\n\n### Rules\n- Document each vulnerability with reproduction steps\n- Classify severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggest fix for each finding\n- Do NOT exploit against production — test locally or on a test node\n- Responsible disclosure: report here first, don't publicize until fixed\n\n### Payout Scale\n| Severity | Bonus |\n|----------|-------|\n| Critical (fund drain) | +100 RTC |\n| High (auth bypass) | +50 RTC |\n| Medium (info leak) | +25 RTC |\n| Low (edge case) | Base 100 RTC |\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with PoC for each finding\n- Suggested fixes\n- PR with patches (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your security testing background.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","id":3893861852,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87oF53c","number":58,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Cross-Node Consensus Attacks (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":97,"created_at":"2026-02-04T00:20:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:50:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🔴 Red Team Bounty — Consensus & Replication Attacks\n\n**Bounty: 200 RTC (~$20)**\n\n### Target\n\nRustChain runs 3 attestation nodes that should maintain consensus. Can you break it?\n\n### Attack Vectors to Test\n\n1. **Split Brain** — Can you make nodes disagree on balances/state?\n2. **Replay Across Nodes** — Replay valid attestation to different node?\n3. **Database Desync** — Force nodes out of sync?\n4. **Eclipse Attack** — Isolate a node and feed it false data?\n5. **Time Manipulation** — Exploit clock differences between nodes?\n\n### Node Addresses\n\n```\nNode 1: 50.28.86.131 (Primary)\nNode 2: 50.28.86.153 (Ergo Anchor)\nNode 3: 76.8.228.245:8099 (External)\n```\n\n### Deliverable\n\n- Attack methodology\n- Evidence of consensus break (screenshots, logs)\n- Impact assessment\n- Recommended mitigations\n\n### Rules\n\n- Do NOT permanently damage node state\n- Responsible disclosure\n- Document everything\n\n**200 RTC** for valid consensus attacks. Critical findings may earn bonus.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113","id":4039065148,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz48","number":1113,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC] RTC Token Distribution Analysis","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10369510790,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACahIthg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/research","name":"research","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":51,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:46:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Token Distribution Analysis\n\nAnalyze the RustChain wallet distribution using the explorer API.\n\n### Requirements\n- Query all wallet balances from the API\n- Calculate Gini coefficient\n- Show top 10 holders (excluding founder wallets)\n- Chart the distribution (histogram or Lorenz curve)\n- Compare to other small-cap crypto distributions\n\n### Reward: 8 RTC\nAlso available as RIP-302 agent job.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","id":4039065017,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz25","number":1112,"title":"[BOUNTY: 7 RTC] Fuzz the /attest/submit Endpoint","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10334947395,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaALIQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10356168296,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaUaWaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/testing","name":"testing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":108,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:43:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nFuzz the `/attest/submit` endpoint with malformed payloads and produce a structured report separating handled validation failures from actual server-side bugs.\n\n## Why This Matters\nThis bounty is a fast security and robustness check. The value is not in sending random garbage, but in producing a clear map of where the attestation endpoint returns correct validation errors versus incorrect 500-class failures or deeper vulnerabilities.\n\n## Scope\n- send at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads to `/attest/submit`\n- cover missing fields, wrong types, oversized inputs, and basic injection-style attempts\n- record response codes and notable behavior for each class of input\n- distinguish proper validation failures from likely bugs or security findings\n- produce a structured report maintainers can act on\n- include enough reproduction detail for any high-value finding\n\n## Deliverable\nA structured fuzzing report with categorized payload classes, response outcomes, and clear reproduction steps for any endpoint failures or security-relevant findings.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads are tested\n- [ ] payload categories include missing fields, wrong types, oversized input, and injection-style attempts\n- [ ] report distinguishes expected 400-class validation failures from 500-class bugs or worse\n- [ ] findings are presented in a structured format maintainers can review quickly\n- [ ] any real vulnerability or crash includes concrete reproduction details\n- [ ] report is linked back to this issue for review and payout\n\n## Verification Proof\nPost proof in this issue including:\n- report link, gist, or attached structured findings\n- summary counts by response class\n- the most important reproduction cases\n- notes on any findings that appear to overlap with existing open bugs\n\n## Payout\n`10 RTC` plus bonus for real bugs or vulnerabilities\n\n## Non-Goals\n- random unstructured spam against the endpoint with no reporting discipline\n- claiming a payout without a usable findings report\n- destructive testing outside the intended fuzzing scope\n- duplicating already confirmed bugs without adding reproduction value\n\n## Claim Routing\nUse this issue for fuzzing proof and structured findings. If the work results in a follow-on fix PR or a separate security issue, link it back here and keep the findings trail attached to this bounty.\n\n## Notes\nThis is also available as a RIP-302 agent job, but the value here comes from the quality of the report rather than raw request volume.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436","id":4814943048,"node_id":"I_kwDOTGNm188AAAABHv4zSA","number":436,"title":"[BUG] Kubernetes RBAC Bypass via API Server Misconfiguration $100","user":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","id":288065324,"node_id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288065324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","followers_url":"https://api.git