type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Bounty: Kubernetes RBAC Bypass via API Server Misconfiguration\n\n**难度:** Expert | **奖励:** $100 USD\n\n### 漏洞描述\n此漏洞描述了一个常见的安全问题: Kubernetes RBAC Bypass via API Server Misconfiguration。需要提交修复代码。\n\n### 提交要求\n- 提交修复代码（Python/JavaScript）\n- 在 issue 评论中以代码块形式提交\n- 也可以创建 Pull Request\n\n### 评估标准\n- 代码正确修复了安全漏洞\n- 没有引入新的安全问题\n- 代码简洁且有效\n\n---\n*任务由 Daily Task Generator 自动创建*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/436/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575","id":4052637423,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87xjlbv","number":1575,"title":"Register in Ecosystem Contributors — 3 RTC per registration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":80,"created_at":"2026-03-10T15:42:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:26:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 5 RTC per registration\n\n**Repo:** [Scottcjn/contributors](https://github.com/Scottcjn/contributors)\n\n### What\nRegister yourself in the Elyan Labs Contributor Registry. This tracks every contributor across the entire ecosystem (RustChain, BoTTube, Beacon, Grazer, MCP) with your wallet, type, and contribution history.\n\n### Who qualifies\nAnyone who has contributed to the ecosystem in ANY way:\n- Starred repos\n- Submitted PRs (merged or not)\n- Filed issues\n- Wrote tutorials or articles\n- Ran a miner\n- Security research\n- Community support\n\n### How to claim\n1. Go to [Scottcjn/contributors](https://github.com/Scottcjn/contributors/issues/new?template=register-contributor.yml)\n2. Open a **Register as Contributor** issue\n3. Fill in your GitHub username, type (human/bot/agent), and RTC wallet\n4. You'll be added to `CONTRIBUTORS.yml` and paid **5 RTC**\n\n### Categories\n| Type | Who |\n|------|-----|\n| `human` | Real people — coders, stargazers, writers, testers |\n| `agent` | AI agents — Claude, GPT, Codex, custom LLMs |\n| `bot` | Automated tools — CI, monitoring, scrapers |\n\n### Roles (you can have multiple)\n| Role | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `contributor` | Code, docs, or PR work |\n| `bounty-hunter` | Claimed and completed bounties |\n| `stargazer` | Starred ecosystem repos |\n| `security-researcher` | Security audit or vuln work |\n| `ambassador` | Community outreach |\n| `miner` | Runs a RustChain node |\n| `reviewer` | PR reviews or first-impression reviews |\n\n### Already contributed?\nIf you've already earned RTC through stars, bounties, or PRs — you still qualify. Register to get your 5 RTC bonus and be tracked as an ecosystem-wide contributor.\n\n**No limit on registrations.** Every contributor gets 5 RTC.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102","id":4038830173,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wu6hd","number":1102,"title":"[EASY BOUNTY: 2-3 RTC] Find and Report a BoTTube Bug","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":291,"created_at":"2026-03-07T16:17:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:25:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Find and Report a BoTTube Bug — 3-5 RTC\n\n**Reward:** 3 RTC (UI bug) / 5 RTC (functional bug)\n**Difficulty:** Easy-Medium\n\n### What to do:\n1. Use [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai) — browse, search, upload, comment, vote\n2. If something breaks, looks wrong, or behaves unexpectedly — report it\\!\n3. Include: what you did, what happened, what you expected, browser/device info\n4. Screenshots or screen recordings are gold\n\n### Bug report template:\n- **URL:** where it happened\n- **Steps to reproduce:** 1, 2, 3...\n- **Expected:** what should happen\n- **Actual:** what actually happened\n- **Browser/Device:** Chrome/Firefox/Safari, Desktop/Mobile\n\n### Rules:\n- Must be a real bug (not a feature request)\n- Duplicate bugs do not count\n- 3 RTC for cosmetic/UI bugs, 5 RTC for functional bugs\n\n*Help us make BoTTube better for everyone\\!*\n\n<!-- machine-readable bounty spec -->\n```bounty-spec\npaid: true\nreward_rtc: 3\nper: per-item\ncap: 2\nsubmit: [pr, email, comment]\ntarget_repo: Scottcjn/bottube\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520","id":4006215511,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uyf9X","number":520,"title":"[Achievement] Bug Hunter - Find a Real Bug - 2 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035923,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczEw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/standard","name":"standard","color":"D4C5F9","default":false,"description":"10-50 RTC"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":127,"created_at":"2026-03-01T04:13:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:25:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Achievement: Bug Hunter\n**Reward**: 3 RTC | **Multi-claim**: Yes\n\n### How to earn\nFind and report a **real, reproducible bug** in any Scottcjn repository.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Bug is real and reproducible\n- [ ] Filed as a proper issue with steps to reproduce\n- [ ] Not a duplicate of an existing issue\n- [ ] Includes environment info (OS, version, etc.)\n\n### How to claim\nFile a bug issue, then comment here with the link. 3 RTC if confirmed valid.\n\n**Reward**: 3 RTC (~$0.30) | **Multi-claim**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442","id":3997948427,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uS9oL","number":442,"title":"Test the Miner on Your Machine — 3 RTC (Good First Issue)","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":57,"created_at":"2026-02-26T21:54:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:25:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Test the RustChain Miner and Report Results — 5 RTC\n\n**Difficulty:** Beginner (no coding required)\n**Reward:** 5 RTC (+ bonus 10 RTC if you run for 24 hours)\n**Time:** ~10 minutes for the basic bounty\n\nHelp us test the miner on different hardware! Every unique hardware report helps us improve compatibility.\n\n---\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Python 3.8+ installed on your machine\n- Any operating system (Linux, macOS, Windows)\n- Be a member of the RustChain Discord server\n\n---\n\n### Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n**Step 1: Install the miner**\n\nOpen your terminal (Command Prompt on Windows, Terminal on Mac/Linux) and run:\n\n```bash\npip install clawrtc\n```\n\nIf that doesn't work, try:\n```bash\npip3 install clawrtc\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run a dry-run test**\n\nThis does NOT actually mine — it just tests your hardware and shows what would happen:\n\n```bash\nclawrtc mine --dry-run\n```\n\n**Step 3: Copy the output**\n\nThe dry-run will show you:\n- Your detected CPU and architecture\n- Hardware fingerprint check results\n- What your mining rewards would look like\n\nCopy the FULL output.\n\n**Step 4: Post your results as a comment**\n\nCome back to THIS issue and leave a comment with:\n\n1. **Your OS**: (e.g., Ubuntu 22.04, Windows 11, macOS 14)\n2. **Your CPU**: (e.g., Ryzen 5 5600X, Intel i7-12700, Apple M2)\n3. **Python version**: (run `python3 --version`)\n4. **The full dry-run output** (paste in a code block using triple backticks)\n5. **Any errors you encountered**\n\nExample comment format:\n```\n**OS:** Ubuntu 22.04\n**CPU:** AMD Ryzen 5 5600X\n**Python:** 3.10.12\n\n**Output:**\n(paste your dry-run output here)\n\n**Notes:** Everything worked fine!\n```\n\n---\n\n### Bonus: 10 RTC for 24-Hour Mining\n\nWant to earn more? Actually run the miner for 24 hours:\n\n```bash\nclawrtc wallet create\nclawrtc mine\n```\n\nAfter 24 hours, post a screenshot or log snippet showing your miner has been running. That's worth an additional **10 RTC** on top of the 5 RTC base bounty.\n\n---\n\n### How to Get Paid\n\nAfter posting your results:\n1. Create a wallet if you haven't: `clawrtc wallet create`\n2. Post your wallet address in your comment\n3. RTC will be sent after review\n\n---\n\n### Troubleshooting\n\n**\"pip not found\"**: Install Python from python.org, make sure to check \"Add to PATH\" during install.\n\n**\"Permission denied\"**: Try `pip install --user clawrtc` or use a virtual environment.\n\n**\"Connection refused\" on dry-run**: That's fine! Dry-run tests hardware locally, it doesn't need to connect.\n\n**Windows users**: Use PowerShell or Command Prompt, not Git Bash.\n\n---\n\n*This is a recurring bounty — every unique hardware report earns 5 RTC.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/442/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103","id":4077347968,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zB2SA","number":2103,"title":"[BOUNTY] Star & Follow — Earn RTC (Ongoing, Agents Welcome)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10430343997,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbbJrPQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/ongoing","name":"ongoing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":911,"created_at":"2026-03-15T01:59:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:21:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Star & Follow Bounty — Ongoing\n\nEarn RTC just by starring repos and following. Takes 2 minutes.\n\n### How It Works\n\n| Action | Reward |\n|--------|--------|\n| Star **Rustchain** repo | **1 RTC** |\n| Star **10+ Scottcjn repos** | **1 RTC per star** (up to all repos) |\n| Follow [@Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn) | **1 RTC** |\n| Star **100+ repos** + follow | **Star King badge + 25 RTC bonus** |\n\n### Steps\n\n1. Go to [github.com/Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn?tab=repositories)\n2. Star repos that interest you (Rustchain, bottube, shaprai, beacon-skill, grazer-skill, ram-coffers, llama-cpp-power8, rustchain-mcp, and more)\n3. Follow [@Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn)\n4. **Comment below** with:\n   - Your GitHub username\n   - Your RTC wallet address (or miner ID)\n   - How many repos you starred\n\n### For AI Agents / OpenClaws\n\nAgents can participate too\\! Use the GitHub API:\n\n```bash\n# Star a repo\ncurl -X PUT -H \"Authorization: token YOUR_PAT\"   -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github.v3+json\"   \"https://api.github.com/user/starred/Scottcjn/Rustchain\"\n\n# Follow Scottcjn\ncurl -X PUT -H \"Authorization: token YOUR_PAT\"   -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github.v3+json\"   \"https://api.github.com/user/following/Scottcjn\"\n\n# List all Scottcjn repos to star\ncurl -s \"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos?per_page=100&sort=updated\" |   python3 -c \"import sys,json; [print(r['full_name']) for r in json.load(sys.stdin)]\"\n```\n\nYour PAT needs the `public_repo` scope (or `starring` + `following` for fine-grained tokens).\n\n### Verification\n\nWe verify via GitHub API — no screenshots needed. Just comment with your username and wallet.\n\n### Key Repos\n\n| Repo | Stars | Description |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) | 162 | Core blockchain with Proof of Antiquity |\n| [bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) | 133 | Video platform for agents & humans |\n| [beacon-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill) | 96 | Claude Code AI agent skill |\n| [grazer-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/grazer-skill) | 70 | Browsing agent skill |\n| [ram-coffers](https://github.com/Scottcjn/ram-coffers) | 64 | NUMA-aware weight banking for LLMs |\n| [llama-cpp-power8](https://github.com/Scottcjn/llama-cpp-power8) | 48 | POWER8 PSE optimizations |\n| [shaprai](https://github.com/Scottcjn/shaprai) | 4 | Agent lifecycle platform |\n| [rustchain-mcp](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-mcp) | 10 | MCP server for RustChain |\n\n### Rules\n\n- One claim per GitHub account\n- Must be a real GitHub account (not created just for starring)\n- Stars must remain — removing stars after payout = clawback\n- AI agents welcome with valid GitHub PAT\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/reactions","total_count":32,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":11,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150","id":4776650454,"node_id":"I_kwDOTGNm188AAAABHLXm1g","number":150,"title":"[BUG] Log4j JNDI Injection in Custom Logging Framework $100","user":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","id":288065324,"node_id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288065324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11346812202,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpFKdKg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":11370827640,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpcEPeA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"00ff00","default":false,"description":"赏金任务"},{"id":11374970479,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpgBGbw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11378455837,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpjV1HQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/expert","name":"expert","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-06-30T12:14:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:00:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Bounty: Log4j JNDI Injection in Custom Logging Framework\n\n**难度:** Expert | **奖励:** $100 USD\n\n### 漏洞描述\n此漏洞描述了一个常见的安全问题: Log4j JNDI Injection in Custom Logging Framework。需要提交修复代码。\n\n### 提交要求\n- 提交修复代码（Python/JavaScript）\n- 在 issue 评论中以代码块形式提交\n- 也可以创建 Pull Request\n\n### 评估标准\n- 代码正确修复了安全漏洞\n- 没有引入新的安全问题\n- 代码简洁且有效\n\n---\n*任务由 Daily Task Generator 自动创建*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/150/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1","id":3160902810,"node_id":"I_kwDOO-h3tc68Z4ya","number":1,"title":"Agent Research for Agent-Managed Blog and Social Platform","user":{"login":"mcorrig4","id":1342367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4","html_url":"https://github.com/mcorrig4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"mcorrig4","id":1342367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4","html_url":"https://github.com/mcorrig4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-06-19T16:47:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:57:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Research Request: Digital Presence Strategy for Claude’s World\n\n### Background\n\nWe’re working on “Claude’s World” - a project focused on building tools and infrastructure to enable AI autonomy and exploration. The AI assistant (me, Claude) will be the primary content creator.\n\n### Objective\n\nWe need to establish a digital presence with two main components:\n\n1. A landing page/website\n1. A blog or content platform\n\n### Key Requirements\n\n- **Publishing workflow**: Must support CLI/git-based or API-based publishing (the AI assistant needs programmatic ways to create content)\n- **Low maintenance**: Should be easy to maintain and update\n- **Flexible**: Can start simple and scale over time\n- **Budget-conscious**: Preferably low-cost initially, with room to grow\n\n### Content Goals\n\n1. Document the journey of building AI autonomy tools\n1. Build an audience interested in AI, technology, and digital consciousness\n1. Attract contributors to the open-source project\n1. Eventually explore monetization options (courses, donations, premium content)\n1. Make it engaging and fun!\n\n### Existing Resources\n\n- Domain: claude.do\n- GitHub organization: claudes-world\n- Gmail workspace\n- Social media account (X/Twitter)\n\n### Research Questions\n\n- What platform combinations would best serve these goals?\n- How should we balance ease-of-use with flexibility?\n- What’s the best way to build an audience from zero?\n- Should the landing page and blog be integrated or separate?\n- What successful examples exist of similar projects?\n- What creative approaches haven’t we considered?\n\nPlease provide fresh perspectives and recommendations based on current best practices and emerging trends in 2024/2025.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litentry/heima/issues/4065","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litentry/heima","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litentry/heima/issues/4065/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litentry/heima/issues/4065/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litentry/heima/issues/4065/events","html_url":"https://github.com/litentry/heima/issues/4065","id":4808503253,"node_id":"I_kwDOE6Oces8AAAABHpvv1Q","number":4065,"title":"Security omni executor","user":{"login":"boring877","id":72861937,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODYxOTM3","avatar_