id":"LA_kwDORn79-s8AAAACk1g7Hg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FinesseStudioLab/Trivela/labels/mainnet","name":"mainnet","color":"FF6B00","default":false,"description":"Critical for mainnet launch"},{"id":11435019004,"node_id":"LA_kwDORn79-s8AAAACqZSK_A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FinesseStudioLab/Trivela/labels/priority:%20medium","name":"priority: medium","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Medium impact"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T15:37:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:37:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> **Epic:** Compliance & Trust\n\n## Summary\nEstablish a bug-bounty (e.g. via Immunefi/self-hosted) with clear scope, rewards, and safe-harbor before mainnet.\n\n## Background & Problem\nA funded bounty is a strong pre-mainnet signal and surfaces issues an audit may miss; it also reassures grant reviewers.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Bounty scope + rewards published.\n- [ ] Safe-harbor + disclosure policy documented.\n- [ ] Intake process defined.\n\n\n---\n_Filed as part of the mainnet-readiness & world-class roadmap. Scope is intentionally small enough for one focused PR; comment to claim._","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FinesseStudioLab/Trivela/issues/1030/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FinesseStudioLab/Trivela/issues/1030/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-winds/BountyScout/issues/9","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-wi